Ad, store, onboarding, paywall, paying: users leak at every step.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.250
More installs won't fix a funnel that leaks.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.750
"Our CPI looks great. Our revenue doesn't."

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.000
"People install, then disappear."

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.250
"Our agency reports installs."

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.250
"I'm the CEO, the PM and the whole growth team."

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.750
Appfound. Growth partner for consumer & subscription apps.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.600
Every lever between the ad and the payment.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.750
