00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.750
Phase 03, month 3+, overfill the funnel. SEO: pages that rank on Google and pre-sell the install.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.500
AI visibility: get named when people ask AI for an app.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Scale only what pays. Budget goes up when payback proves it.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.000
Your first 90 days, step by step.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Day 0: your Growth Plan (2 minutes). Week 1: kickoff & baseline, tracking fixed.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Week 2: leak map. Weeks 2–3: first creative batch. Weeks 3–6: test & learn.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Weeks 6–12: scale what pays. Weeks 4–12: compound organic. Day 90: review & decide.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.500
Baseline not beaten by day 90? We keep working for free.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.500
You work with me. Not an account manager. Mohamed Barkat.

